      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chenoweth%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Justin Chenoweth's parents, John and Nancy Rose, originally homesteaded in the Chenoweth area during the 1850s and 1860s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chenoweth%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Locals sometimes use the alternative spelling of Chenowith, which is used for the local elementary school.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
