      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chenoweth%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Situated along the Columbia River, Chenoweth is known for its scenic views and outdoor recreational opportunities.",
